OL,3,AKing talks of 'most tragic of days
OL,4,Aimaginable' as he meets survivors of
OL,5,AAberfan disaster 60 years on
OL,6,
OL,7,FPeople in Aberfan, south Wales,
OL,8,Fremember the disaster 60 years ago when
OL,9,Fa coal waste tip collapsed on a school
OL,10,Fand homes
OL,12,FOn 21 October 1966, 116 children and 28
OL,13,Fadults were killed when the colliery
OL,14,Fspoil tip collapsed and engulfed
OL,15,FPantglas Junior School and surrounding
OL,16,Fhouses
OL,18,FMair Morgan, the last surviving teacher
OL,19,Fat the school, still remembers having
OL,20,Fto identify the children who died
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
