OL,3,AKing talks of 'most tragic of days
OL,4,Aimaginable' as he meets survivors of
OL,5,AAberfan disaster 60 years on
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn official inquiry found the National
OL,8,FCoal Board was responsible for the
OL,9,Fdisaster, but no-one has ever been
OL,10,Fprosecuted
OL,12,FOn the anniversary, King Charles, Queen
OL,13,FCamilla and the Prince of Wales laid
OL,14,Fwreaths at a memorial garden that
OL,15,Fstands on the site of the school, and
OL,16,Fjoined survivors, bereaved parents and
OL,17,Fother members of the community
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
